k at JBR is a popular promenade with many food &amp; beverage outlets. <br> -Public Parks &amp; Green Spaces: Landscaped gardens, parks, and lake promenades in the area provide places to walk, jog, relax outdoors. <br> -Children’s Play Areas: Outdoor play areas for kids are available within the community. <br> -Fitness / Gyms: Besides the in‑tower gyms, there are fitness centers nearby. <br> -Transport Access: Good access to public transport (metro, buses), and major roads. <br> -Schools / Nurseries: Schools and childcare / nurseries are within reach in the surrounding area. <br> -Healthcare / Clinics / Pharmacies: Clinics, pharmacies are nearby. <br> -Leisure &amp; Walk‑Areas: The “Walk at JBR”, beach access, waterfront promenade, etc., are close by and used by residents for walks, socializing.<br> <br> Live the JBR lifestyle — spacious, stylish, and steps from the sea. Book your viewing today.<br> <br> Company: Provident Real Estate<br> RERA ORN: 1933<br> ","longitude":55.1351809,"negotiator_id":"11712","negotiator_mapping":"grzegorz@providentestate.com","parking":["1"],"price":3200000,"price_qualifier":null,"publish":1,"search_type":"sales","slug":"1-bedroom-apartment-for-sale-in-jumeirah-gate-tower-1-the-address-jumeirah-resort-spa-jumeirah-beach-residence-dubai","status":"For Sale","thumbnail":"http://provident-bx-upload-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/iblock/a0f/8iztnbbkwke0mxkm9ci10dt035t195lp/download-_17_.jpg","title":"1 bedroom apartment for sale","extra":{"views":"","cheques":null,"project":null,"bitrix_id":"1487431","furnished":"Furnished","permit_number":"7135260230","rental_period":null,"current_status":"","furnishing_type":"Furnished","completion_status":"completed","property_condition":"","property_managed_by_us":""},"video_tour":[],"virtual_tour":[],"qr_code":null,"premium":0,"link_to_employee":{"id":"11712","url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/prov-email-signatures/Grzegorz-Kostka-PFB.png","name":"Grzegorz Kostka","email":"grzegorz@providentestat